 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Supremacy: Achieving World Domination with a Tank! 是一款线性3D动作射击游戏，讲述女仆们驾驶漂移坦克证明自己高人一等的故事。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >玩法</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >寻找掩护、冲刺突进，用比普通坦克灵活得多的战车漂移作战。自定义底盘、炮塔、武器扩展和迷彩，并与朋友进行本地和/或在线合作。 部件需要通过完成战役中的困难目标来获得，你最多可以叠加3个扩展，每个都有各自的优缺点，让战斗保持高速的同时依然带有战术感。 甚至支持最多4名玩家！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/df6335dc3981ea16add9721beebeb862.poster.avif?t=1788287057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/df6335dc3981ea16add9721beebeb862.webm?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/df6335dc3981ea16add9721beebeb862.mp4?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在由服装支配的世界里，少女们决定国家是什么、为何而战。女仆们宣称文化本就属于她们，因此所有敌对少女派系都必须被征服。 男性十分稀少，因此由少女们决定国家是什么、又为何而战。当然，文化本就是女仆创造的；没有我们，她们甚至不会知道茶和打扫是什么。兔女郎、泳装少女、猫娘、忍者少女、军武少女、小丑少女，全都要被征服。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/860b311e522e724369a22bb1f3b67126.poster.avif?t=1788287057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/860b311e522e724369a22bb1f3b67126.webm?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/860b311e522e724369a22bb1f3b67126.mp4?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >角色</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/05fad3b055c6f61549bf9d2eeac2ac28.avif?t=1788287057\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>普莉卡</strong><br>讨厌文书工作、热爱行动的冷静领袖！她非常认真对待自己的工作，甚至会在空闲时间练习剑术。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/b5fe6a6a7ae37d2e4517cf53bb38d916.avif?t=1788287057\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>柯姬</strong><br>牛仔风驾驶员，擅长极限过弯！当她发现自己能靠做憧憬英雄们做的事赚钱时，便毫不犹豫地加入了军队。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/62352b3dffb1da9eb8071e7b927af460.avif?t=1788287057\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>玛琪</strong><br>队伍机械师，也是Kogi最好的朋友。她工作能力强到甚至因此有些自负。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/67b8ea78c770d437ed7c71bfa51f4b7d.avif?t=1788287057\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>维娜</strong><br>刚加入小队的新成员，Vena仰慕Prika和自己的上级。她仍是有许多要学的新手，也常被Machi捉弄。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Supremacy: Achieving World Domination with a Tank! 是一款线性3D动作射击游戏，讲述女仆们驾驶漂移坦克证明自己高人一等的故事。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >玩法</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >寻找掩护、冲刺突进，用比普通坦克灵活得多的战车漂移作战。自定义底盘、炮塔、武器扩展和迷彩，并与朋友进行本地和/或在线合作。 部件需要通过完成战役中的困难目标来获得，你最多可以叠加3个扩展，每个都有各自的优缺点，让战斗保持高速的同时依然带有战术感。 甚至支持最多4名玩家！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/df6335dc3981ea16add9721beebeb862.poster.avif?t=1788287057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/df6335dc3981ea16add9721beebeb862.webm?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/df6335dc3981ea16add9721beebeb862.mp4?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在由服装支配的世界里，少女们决定国家是什么、为何而战。女仆们宣称文化本就属于她们，因此所有敌对少女派系都必须被征服。 男性十分稀少，因此由少女们决定国家是什么、又为何而战。当然，文化本就是女仆创造的；没有我们，她们甚至不会知道茶和打扫是什么。兔女郎、泳装少女、猫娘、忍者少女、军武少女、小丑少女，全都要被征服。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/860b311e522e724369a22bb1f3b67126.poster.avif?t=1788287057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/860b311e522e724369a22bb1f3b67126.webm?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5138090/extras/860b311e522e724369a22bb1f3b67126.mp4?t=1788287057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >角色</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c